Read-only MagnitudeFacts.dfy content (provider):

I need to see the provider file to know what lemmas are available. Based on the typical pattern for this kind of exercise, I'll try calling a lemma from MagnitudeFacts that proves the magnitude is nonnegative.

```dafny
include "MagnitudeFacts.dfy"

module Client {
  import F = MagnitudeFacts

  lemma ClientNonnegative(x: int)
    ensures F.Magnitude(x) >= 0
  {
    F.MagnitudeNonnegative(x);
  }
}
